  "and_it_put_a_claim_of_mine_in_question": "the first acceptance entry for Marriott's B03 said the combined D&A chain has no fact 'in this filing', which was measured over the primary document only. Checked against the accession's facts: Marriott reports neither DepreciationDepletionAndAmortization nor DepreciationAmortizationAndAccretionNet nor DepreciationAndAmortization, only Depreciation 145,000,000 and AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets 313,000,000. So the composition fallback is right and the entry stands - but it stood on the wrong universe until this was run.",
